  "version": "0.1",
  "summary": "Einstein's special and general relativity as four spaces, each with its own jurisdiction (the set of legal operations): Minkowski, curved spacetime, the tangent space, the space of metrics; the crossings between them; measured numbers (Mercury, light deflection, GPS clocks, the binary pulsar, gravitational waves).",
  "confidence_floor": "ESTABLISHED",
