  },
  "permissions": [],
  "dependencies": {},
  "provenance": {
    "origin": "Cody, 2026-11-19: 'i need a Full Engine Protocol for Einstein's Relativity, general and special' and, on the first layout, 'relativity is a different space isn't it? different jurisdictions...it should not be following a L_SM layout at all'. Organised as four spaces, each declared with the eight fields of the spatial-simulation skill and a legal-operation set (the test of bracketing_firing_order.jurisdiction_violation, reused). Built from the textbook theory (Einstein 1905, 1915; Minkowski 1908; Schwarzschild 1916; Friedmann 1922; Peters 1964); no framework constant used. The bridge file states ESTABLISHED arithmetic and INTERPRETATION separately.",
    "authors": [
      "Cody Michael Allison"
    ],
    "created": "2026-11-19",
    "status_label": "ESTABLISHED",
